  "releaseNotes": "- [ThunderPropagator#25] [Background Workers] AbstractThunderPropagatorConnection — receive loop thread safety, unlinked lifecycle, and startup blocking   Already implemented (from prior PRs #50/#57):   - Receive loop linked to ApplicationStopping token ✅   - TaskCreationOptions.LongRunning ✅   - ManualResetEvent replaced with TaskCompletionSource ✅   - Single CancellationTokenSource per connection lifetime ✅   - DisconnectAsync drains in-flight reads before closing transport (DrainReceiveLoopAsync with 500ms drain) ✅",
